ry conclusion  that's what this year is for i hope i  will make no predictions on when i will  finish  every time i do a-holes on the internet  take that as a promise  and then wait eagerly to crucify me when  i miss the deadline  all i will say is that i am hopeful i  have a zillion other things to do as  well though  every time i wrap up one thing three  more things land on me  monkeys on my back a.a i've sung that  song before  so many monkeys and kong but that is  something he will discuss on a later  date  he finishes it up by saying meanwhile  guys and gals  keep yourself safe and healthy i will  try to do the same  well i believe it was the isolation that  helped him the most  it's hard to get distracted by a lot of  other things when you really can't leave  the house  now there was one thing i found very  interesting about this update  for those of you who have followed  george over the years or even if you  have only seen my ones of winter update  videos  you would know that he is the master of  not revealing too much information  he did reveal something in this update  though he sort of revealed how much more  he has to write before he's finished  he said he wrote hundreds and hundreds  of pages last year  but he still needs to write a few  hundred more in order to bring the book  to a satisfactory conclusion  now assuming that's an accurate  estimation we can make a guess at how  much longer it will take for him to  finish it  based on what he said in the update he  is able to write hundreds of pages in  one year  if it's a great year of writing which it  doesn't seem like that happens very  often  otherwise the book would already be done  since he still has a few hundred pages  to go  it might take him another year or even  longer if it's not a very good year for  him  this is the ones of winner though and we  all know how many times it was delayed  so i won't go holding my breath waiting  for the book i still think this is  exciting news  hopefully geor